1: $3 \times (3+1) = 3 \times 4 = 12$
2: $5 \times (1+1) = 5 \times 2 = 10$
3: $2 \times (4+1) = 2 \times 5 = 10$
4: $1 \times (10+1) = 1 \times 11 = 11$
Max is 12.

