$(i+0.5)^2 + (j+0.5)^2 \le R^2$
$(i+0.5)^2 + (j-0.5)^2 \le R^2$
$(i-0.5)^2 + (j+0.5)^2 \le R^2$
$(i-0.5)^2 + (j-0.5)^2 \le R^2$

Notice that $(i+0.5)^2$ is always greater than or equal to $(i-0.5)^2$ if $i \ge 0$, and vice versa.
